{"title":"Ogre Mauler","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"q-alert-banner gg-alert\" role=\"note\"><svg class=\"q-alert-ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3 2 21h20z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M12 10v5M12 17.6v.4\" stroke=\"#1b1300\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg><span>It lives on <b>Ogre Isle</b>, which you can only reach after finishing <a href=\"#/guide/quest-plymouth-the-ogre-traitor\">The Ogre Traitor</a> (Gerald Seabroden).</span></p><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 38 Ogre that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">stab</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 42 times (6.1% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/ogre-bone-needle\">Ogre Bone Needle</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-mauler\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-mauler?lv=37\">Lv 37 <span>215</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-mauler?lv=38\">Lv 38 <span>841</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-mauler?lv=39\">Lv 39 <span>151</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-mauler?lv=40\">Lv 40 <span>177</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-mauler?lv=41\">Lv 41 <span>50</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-mauler?lv=43\">Lv 43 <span>35</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-mauler?lv=49\">Lv 49 <span>129</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-mauler?lv=50\">Lv 50 <span>826</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-mauler?lv=53\">Lv 53 <span>294</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-mauler?lv=54\">Lv 54 <span>843</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-mauler?lv=55\">Lv 55 <span>138</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-mauler?lv=37\" title=\"Pick level 37\"><td><b>37</b></td><td>168</td><td>24.9</td><td>1,850</td><td class=\"muted\">504 · 34.9 · 5,550</td><td>215</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Plymouth%20Wharf\">Plymouth Wharf</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-mauler?lv=38\" title=\"Pick level 38\"><td><b>38</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>176</td><td>25.4</td><td>1,900</td><td class=\"muted\">528 · 35.6 · 5,700</td><td>841</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Plymouth%20Wharf\">Plymouth Wharf</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-mauler?lv=39\" title=\"Pick level 39\"><td><b>39</b></td><td>185</td><td>26</td><td>1,950</td><td class=\"muted\">555 · 36.4 · 5,850</td><td>151</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Plymouth%20Wharf\">Plymouth Wharf</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-mauler?lv=40\" title=\"Pick level 40\"><td><b>40</b></td><td>194</td><td>26.5</td><td>2,000</td><td class=\"muted\">582 · 37.1 · 6,000</td><td>177</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Plymouth%20Wharf\">Plymouth Wharf</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-mauler?lv=41\" title=\"Pick level 41\"><td><b>41</b></td><td>203</td><td>27.1</td><td>2,050</td><td class=\"muted\">609 · 37.9 · 6,150</td><td>50</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-mauler?lv=43\" title=\"Pick level 43\"><td><b>43</b></td><td>222</td><td>28.2</td><td>2,150</td><td class=\"muted\">666 · 39.5 · 6,450</td><td>35</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-mauler?lv=49\" title=\"Pick level 49\"><td><b>49</b></td><td>290</td><td>31.5</td><td>2,450</td><td class=\"muted\">870 · 44.1 · 7,350</td><td>129</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-mauler\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>50</b></td><td>303</td><td>32</td><td>2,500</td><td class=\"muted\">909 · 44.8 · 7,500</td><td>826</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-mauler?lv=53\" title=\"Pick level 53\"><td><b>53</b></td><td>344</td><td>33.7</td><td>2,650</td><td class=\"muted\">1,032 · 47.2 · 7,950</td><td>294</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-mauler?lv=54\" title=\"Pick level 54\"><td><b>54</b></td><td>358</td><td>34.2</td><td>2,700</td><td class=\"muted\">1,074 · 47.9 · 8,100</td><td>843</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-mauler?lv=55\" title=\"Pick level 55\"><td><b>55</b></td><td>374</td><td>34.8</td><td>2,750</td><td class=\"muted\">1,122 · 48.7 · 8,250</td><td>138</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      <h2>Appearance</h2><p class=\"s muted\">How the game draws it. Archers and mages wear better armor as their level goes up.</p><div class=\"look-grid\"><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/8e37a810e3fd83e6f740.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Plain</b><div class=\"g-note\">Any level</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/f494a23c6beedc0d7ceb.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Archer</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 25–44 · Werewolfpelt armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/8e37a810e3fd83e6f740.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Warrior</b><div class=\"g-note\">Any level</div></div></div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 434 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 509 recorded drops, 24,836 total, 12–259 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×12–259</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"ogrewax-knick\" title=\"Ogrewax Knick - in 434 of 434 looted corpses, 394 recorded drops, 394 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b734a810757d0d5d1409.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogrewax Knick</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"mana-potion-large\" title=\"Mana Potion Large - in 14 of 434 looted corpses, 14 recorded drops, 14 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a4a127458a5f5f489058.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mana Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/31<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"health-potion-large\" title=\"Health Potion Large - in 12 of 434 looted corpses, 10 recorded drops, 10 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/752437a6ecea30afa5ec.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Health Potion Large</span><span